MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A wake that opens a call in silence is indistinguishable from one that did
nothing, especially with the screen off. The phone now says 我在 through the
chosen voice as the call page opens; with no voice configured it stays quiet,
and the chime and the vibration already carried the answer.

The rest is unchanged from the previous round: 小安's stream policy (reset only
after 5 s of quiet or 15 s), a two-second record buffer read 1024 samples at a
time, a wake request answered on the first frame when no chat screen was up,
and 唤醒词 matched as typed.
